Truy cập theo đường dẫn &lt;code&gt;OnthiTHPT\De-thi-thu-TN-THPT-2026-mon-Toan-So-GD-Tuyen-Quang\word\media&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://hackmd.io/_uploads/SkP_rrZqfe.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;image&#34; loading=&#34;lazy&#34; src=&#34;https://hackmd.io/_uploads/rkadrrZ9Gx.png&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
